   132	operation, but that alone does not repair failure atomicity. A globally fenced,
   133	fail-closed managed writer is a future candidate, not an implemented guarantee.
   134	Power-loss durability remains unqualified. Successful concurrent conditional
   135	updates, cancellation during WHERE evaluation, clean restart and recovery after
   136	a read-triggered OOM are narrower observations than crash-safe writes.
