   168	### 2.2 Can the ledger serve it? Field by field
   169	
   170	| `TransactionRecord` field (`Triples.ts:108-118`) | Legacy source | Derivable from ledger rows? |
   171	|---|---|---|
   172	| `txId`, `position`, `instant` | `:_tx/position`, `:_tx/instant` facts | `position` yes (`recorded_position` of the rows). `instant` yes (`recorded_at`). `txId` yes (`tx_id`). But see "which transactions are journaled" below. |
   173	| `actor`, `commandId`, `correlationId`, `causationId`, `configSnapshot` | `:_tx/*` string facts | **No.** Claims store only commandId, txId, timestamp, position (XTDB `:231-245`). The rest is never passed to the adapter. |
   174	| `changes[]` with `op: "assert"` | `:_tx/change` JSON from `transactionChangeFromTriple` (`transactionMetadata.ts:9-27`) | **Yes.** Rows with `tx_id = T`: `tripleId=id, entityId, attribute, entityType, value, validFrom, validTo, recordedAt, assertionTxId=tx_id`. All immutable after insert. |
